OL,5,G1700 Inside the Tower of London
OL,6,     FThe crowning of Charles III means
OL,7,     Fthe Beefeaters' uniforms must be
OL,8,     Fupdated to acknowledge the new
OL,9,     FKing. Plus big changes to the
OL,10,     Fmoat, and a look at Henry VIII's
OL,11,     Fbeloved mother.
OL,12,G1800 Inside the Tower of London
OL,13,     FIt's May 2023 and preparations are
OL,14,     Funder way for one of the biggest
OL,15,     Froyal occasions in seven decades:
OL,16,     Fthe coronation of King Charles
OL,17,     FIII, with 17 Yeoman Warders
OL,18,     Fjoining 4,000 troops.
