OL,5,G1900 Ben Fogle: New Lives in the Wild
OL,6,     FIn Dorset, Ben spends a week with
OL,7,     FChris, a former paratrooper who
OL,8,     Fhas spent the last five years
OL,9,     Fwalking the UK's coastline,
OL,10,     Ffinding love and raising thousands
OL,11,     Ffor charity.
OL,12,G2000 Ben Fogle: New Lives in the Wild
OL,13,     FBen returns to Western Australia
OL,14,     Fto catch up with charismatic widow
OL,15,     FBarbara. Since he last saw her,
OL,16,     Fthere has been a serious cancer
OL,17,     Fscare and a devastating bush
OL,18,     Ffire...
